-category notice is not automatically a new ordinary scholarship window. Do not wait for the next summer deadline without checking whether a specific current notice applies to you."}]],"$undefined","$L1e","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]]}],"$L1f",false,false,false,"$L20",false,"$L21","$L22"]}],"$L23"]}]
