26:["$","section","3-Resident, commuter and non-resident: explain the housing evidence",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Resident, commuter and non-resident: explain the housing evidence"}],[["$","p","ER.GO distinguishes student statuses when calculating benefits, and its guidance requires appropriate domicile evidence for non-resident status. Living abroad before arrival is not, by itself, a substitute for the required study-period housing documentation.",{"children":"ER.GO distinguishes student statuses when calculating benefits, and its guidance requires appropriate domicile evidence for non-resident status. Living abroad before arrival is not, by itself, a substitute for the required study-period housing documentation."}],["$","p","Before signing a contract, check the accepted type of accommodation, duration, registration and submission requirements. Also understand what changes if you accept a residence place, live privately, commute or cannot document the expected domicile. Ask about your exact category before calculating a budget from the largest advertised amount.",{"children":"Before signing a contract, check the accepted type of accommodation, duration, registration and submission requirements. Also understand what changes if you accept a residence place, live privately, commute or cannot document the expected domicile. Ask about your exact category before calculating a budget from the largest advertised amount."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","aside",null,{"className":"worked-example","children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Worked example"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"A student admitted in Bologna plans to rent privately. Their practical tasks are not just “apply for scholarship”: they must check the domicile rule, obtain a suitable contract and submit evidence by the relevant deadline. This is a planning example, not an eligibility decision."}]]}],"$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://www.er-go.it/international-students/focus-on-scholarship",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.er-go.it/international-students/focus-on-scholarship","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"ER.GO status and domicile guidance"}]]}]]]}],"$undefined"]}]
27:["$","section","4-Application workflow: admission and benefits remain separate",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Application workflow: admission and benefits remain separate"}],[["$","p","Maintain a university record and an ER.GO record. The university record contains the programme offer, academic documents and enrolment actions. The benefit record contains the annual application, economic evidence, housing request and ranking checks. Connect the two without assuming one authority automatically completes the other’s tasks.",{"children":"Maintain a university record and an ER.GO record. The university record contains the programme offer, academic documents and enrolment actions. The benefit record contains the annual application, economic evidence, housing request and ranking checks. Connect the two without assuming one authority automatically completes the other’s tasks."}],["$","p","A draft form is not a completed application. Read the submission instructions, keep the receipt and monitor the personal area used for your benefit. If an uploaded document is unclear, use the official support channel and refer to your application rather than sending sensitive evidence to an unofficial adviser.",{"children":"A draft form is not a completed application. Read the submission instructions, keep the receipt and monitor the personal area used for your benefit. If an uploaded document is unclear, use the official support channel and refer to your application rather than sending sensitive evidence to an unofficial adviser."}]],["$","ol",null,{"className":"process-steps","aria-label":"Application workflow: admission and benefits remain separate","children":[["$","li","Find your annual announcement and covered institution.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":1}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Find your annual announcement and covered institution."}]]}],["$","li","Confirm economic, merit and enrolment conditions for your category.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":2}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Confirm economic, merit and enrolment conditions for your category."}]]}],["$","li","Prepare the required overseas evidence and accepted translations.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":3}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Prepare the required overseas evidence and accepted translations."}]]}],["$","li","Submit the benefit and any housing request through the official service.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":4}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Submit the benefit and any housing request through the official service."}]]}],["$","li","Save the receipt and track rankings and outstanding conditions.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":5}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Save the receipt and track rankings and outstanding conditions."}]]}],["$","li","Complete enrolment and later merit requirements within the applicable dates.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":6}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Complete enrolment and later merit requirements within the applicable dates."}]]}]]}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
28:["$","section","5-Read the result before treating it as money available",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Read the result before treating it as money available"}],[["$","p","ER.GO explains that an eligible position means the requirements are met; assignment and any suspended condition must still be understood. A position can be affected by an enrolment record that has not yet become active. The official FAQ directs students to the university secretariat when that is the cause.",{"children":"ER.GO explains that an eligible position means the requirements are met; assignment and any suspended condition must still be understood. A position can be affected by an enrolment record that has not yet become active. The official FAQ directs students to the university secretariat when that is the cause."}],["$","p","Keep an action log after results appear: status, reason, authority to contact and deadline for a response. If a correction route is available, follow the official channel within its window. Do not rely on a social-media post describing another student’s payment as your own payment timetable.",{"children":"Keep an action log after results appear: status, reason, authority to contact and deadline for a response. If a correction route is available, follow the official channel within its window. Do not rely on a social-media post describing another student’s payment as your own payment timetable."}]],"$undefined",[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Turn a result into an action","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"Turn a result into an action"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","What you see",{"scope":"col","children":"What you see"}],["$","th","What to check next",{"scope":"col","children":"What to check next"}]],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Eligible"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Whether the benefit has been assigned and conditions remain"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Suspended or conditional"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"The stated reason and institution responsible for clearing it"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","2",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Excluded"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Whether a documented correction or review route exists"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","3",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Assigned"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Payment/service conditions, account details and later obligations"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Source: ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.er-go.it/international-students/focus-on-scholarship","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Official guidance"}]]}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
29:["$","section","6-Plan the weeks before the first payment",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-7","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Plan the weeks before the first payment"}],[["$","p","Make a start-up budget independently of the scholarship headline. Travel, housing deposits, document preparation and initial living costs may arise before support is usable. If part of the benefit is delivered as a service, do not count that value again as unrestricted cash.",{"children":"Make a start-up budget independently of the scholarship headline. Travel, housing deposits, document preparation and initial living costs may arise before support is usable. If part of the benefit is delivered as a service, do not count that value again as unrestricted cash."}],["$","p","A useful budget has two versions: one with the benefit confirmed and one while the outcome is unresolved. This does not predict rejection; it shows what funding gap would prevent arrival or enrolment if the money is not available when needed.",{"children":"A useful budget has two versions: one with the benefit confirmed and one while the outcome is unresolved. This does not predict rejection; it shows what funding gap would prevent arrival or enrolment if the money is not available when needed."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Plan the weeks before the first payment","children":[["$","$L5","/tools/italy-study-cost-calculator/",{"href":"/tools/italy-study-cost-calculator/","children":["Estimate your Italy study budget",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L5","/guides/university-of-bologna-admissions-scholarships/",{"href":"/guides/university-of-bologna-admissions-scholarships/","children":["Read the Bologna admission guide",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
2a:["$","section","7-Before the next application: retain your evidence trail",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Before the next application: retain your evidence trail"}],[["$","p","Save the annual announcement, submitted form, original documents, translations and every official message in a cycle-labelled folder. A later renewal is a new task with its own rules; do not assume the previous award renews automatically. Record the academic evidence you will need while there is still time to obtain it.",{"children":"Save the annual announcement, submitted form, original documents, translations and every official message in a cycle-labelled folder. A later renewal is a new task with its own rules; do not assume the previous award renews automatically. Record the academic evidence you will need while there is still time to obtain it."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","$L2b",null,{"id":"scholarships/ergo-scholarship:section-8","title":"Check your progress","items":["I selected the right institution and study year.","I checked the reference period for every financial document.","I understand my domicile category and housing evidence.","I saved the final submission receipt.","I know how to read a condition or exclusion.","I have a budget before any payment arrives."]}],"$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Before the next application: retain your evidence trail","children":[["$","$L5","/guides/italy-dsu-scholarships/",{"href":"/guides/italy-dsu-scholarships/","children":["General DSU overview",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L5","/guides/isee-parificato-international-students/",{"href":"/guides/isee-parificato-international-students/","children":["Understand ISEE-related documents",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
